    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a clear reliance on elite power-speed combinations, anchored by **Gunnar Henderson** (76.04) and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (74.56). **Gunnar Henderson** faces a significant test against the ace-caliber Gerrit Cole, but he remains a must-start due to a 16% park-factor boost and his dynamic platoon advantage. Similarly, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** benefits from a favorable matchup against Kyle Bradish; the combination of a 16% park uplift and a 14% platoon advantage makes him our highest-ceiling play today. **Heliot Ramos** (66.19) and **Jacob Wilson** (65.71) also provide strong returns, with **Jacob Wilson** capitalizing on a solid SP_xERA of 4.70 from Randy Dobnak, ensuring we maintain a high floor in both R and RBI categories.\n\nRegarding our bench decisions, **Nasim Nunez** (38.21) was the final player considered for the utility spot, but his position at the bottom of the order and a tough matchup against Jacob deGrom suppressed his score below our operational threshold. We are prioritizing high-leverage lineup positions today to maximize our chances in the scarcity-heavy SB category. While **Wade Meckler** and **Sam Antonacci** offer strong leadoff potential, we must remain vigilant regarding the \"Lineup Pending\" status for all starters. Any late lineup shifts, particularly for **Drake Baldwin** or **Miguel Vargas**, could necessitate an immediate re-evaluation of our efficiency scores to preserve our daily game caps.",
